      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome back to Domashniy Arest! In the campaign headquarters of mayoral candidate Ivan Samsonov, crisis strikes on the eve of the live televised election debate. Campaign strategist Ilona Leonidovna and Ivan's anxious wife Nina discover that Ivan has vanished without a trace after the devastating smear video accusing his grandfather of wartime treason. Let's listen to the scene in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "ilona",
      "t": "Где Самсонов? Он не берёт трубку.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Я не знаю. Он не ночевал дома.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ilona",
      "t": "У нас завтра дебаты!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
