      "t": "'But people believe this lie.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ilona",
      "t": "Мы должны выиграть эти выборы!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We must win this election!'",
      "gap": 0.45
